 The payments are FAILING!!! Please check my payments.

2. Text cleaning
Remove unwanted symbols and extra spaces.

3. Lowercasing
the payments are failing please check my payments

4. Tokenization
["the", "payments", "are", "failing", "please", ...]

5. Stop-word removal (optional)
["payments", "failing", "please", "check", "payments"]

6. Stemming or lemmatization (optional)
["payment", "fail", "please", "check", "payment"]

7. Text representation
BoW or TF-IDF converts the text into numerical features.

8. Machine learning model
Predicts: Payment Issue


Key takeaway: Preprocessing prepares the text; feature extraction converts it into useful numerical inputs when needed;
NER and text classification are tasks performed by a suitable rule-based or trained model. 
Modern models such as BERT can perform both tasks using task-specific configurations, without requiring a TF-IDF step.
